@startuml
[*] --> Waiting for Input

Waiting for Input --> Processing Route : User enters current location and destination

Processing Route --> [*] : Route processing failed
Processing Route --> Fetching Gas Stations : Route processed successfully

Fetching Gas Stations --> [*] : Gas station data retrieval failed
Fetching Gas Stations --> Displaying Results : Gas stations retrieved successfully

Displaying Results --> [*] : User exits
Displaying Results --> Displaying Results : User selects another gas station

@enduml
